rcle of prayer. Amethyst is an Ether gemstone \u2014 she carries the energy of stillness, calm presence and quiet protection, holding space for the parts of the count that ask for silence. The 109th bead, an 8mm lava rock guru bead, closes the circle and holds more than symbolism: its porous stone absorbs a drop of essential oil \u2014 lavender for calm, sandalwood for centering \u2014 turning every mantra into a small ritual of scent and breath. Finished with a hand-tied cotton tassel and delivered in a silk pouch that keeps her energy contained between uses. Cleanse with a pinch of salt before first wear, then let her settle you, one bead at a time. Adorn your own gemstone and sit in your own quiet.</span></p>", "price": 2200.0, "compare_at_price": null, "sku": "RGGE034", "stock": 5, "gemstone": "amethyst", "cut": "", "carat": null, "clarity": "", "metal": "", "images": ["https://qsjzdfwvxshuazhgqoll.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/admin-media/2026/c02a843b-1e0d-4819-84f7-d4b99c0da05b-IMG_9257.jpg?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV85ZDgyYzI2Zi0zY2Y2LTQ1MTQtOWJlYy1hZjQ1MTlmNmE1ZmUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJhZG1pbi1tZWRpYS8yMDI2L2MwMmE4NDNiLTFlMGQtNDgxOS04NGY3LWQ0Yjk5YzBkYTA1Yi1JTUdfOTI1Ny5qcGciLCJzY29wZSI6ImRvd25sb2FkIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg3NDI1NDM3LCJleHAiOjI0MTgxNDU0Mzd9.ejwsxkI6JuENBfYQEbg0nydA5Jfuri03ZvU3FbcX0oM", "https://qsjzdfwvxshuazhgqoll.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/admin-media/2026/397f537d-92bb-48a5-99b8-bbcfeb2bf8d6-IMG_9069.JPG?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV85ZDgyYzI2Zi0zY2Y2LTQ1MTQtOWJlYy1hZjQ1MTlmNmE1ZmUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJhZG1pbi1tZWRpYS8yMDI2LzM5N2Y1MzdkLTkyYmItNDhhNS05OWI4LWJiY2ZlYjJiZjhkNi1JTUdfOTA2OS5KUEciLCJzY29wZSI6ImRvd25sb2FkIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg3NDI1NDQ4LCJleHAiOjI0MTgxNDU0NDh9.AJ3ZRtlVgRuDKmLRzsz9XMdoOpmVt312Xkhbocyo6qc", "https://qsjzdfwvxshuazhgqoll.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/admin-media/2026/5b0ab36c-ab77-43f0-86ba-9af17c5a5c35-IMG_9259.jpg?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5n