513+00:00", "price_overrides": {"AED": 142, "AUD": 55, "CAD": 51, "EUR": 35, "GBP": 31, "SGD": 51, "USD": 39}, "status": "published"}, {"id": "0b297581-0a7a-4c0c-aeb8-681396dd7aeb", "slug": "Iridescent Verse \u2014 Opal Necklace", "category_id": "c6fb8e9c-678f-47d5-a9ca-f3b1ee9b99e0", "name": "Iridescent Verse \u2014 Opal Necklace", "description": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\">Opal Necklace, natural stone in 925 sterling silver, made for everyday wear. Opal is a Water gemstone \u2014 she carries the energy of creativity, hope and gentle emotional depth, changing color the way feeling changes with light. She is also October''s birthstone and the gemstone of Libra (Sep 23 \u2013 Oct 22), a charming, harmonious Air sign, though her creativity is for anyone who wants a little more wonder in the everyday. 5mm, precision-cut stones, light enough to feel like second skin. Wear her as your everyday verse of quiet hope. Adorn your own gemstone and hold your own light.</span></p>", "price": 2200.0, "compare_at_price": null, "sku": "RGGE021", "stock": 5, "gemstone": "opal", "cut": null, "carat": 0.31, "clarity": null, "metal": "925 Silver", "images": [], "is_new": false, "is_bestseller": false, "is_trending": false, "sort_order": 21, "created_at": "2026-07-08T16:19:31.964481+00:00", "meta_title": "Opal Necklace \u2014 Iridescent Verse | Rosado Gems", "meta_description": "Discover the Iridescent Verse Opal Necklace by Rosado Gems. Natural opal in sterling silver, perfect for everyday wear. A gemstone of creativity & hope.", "updated_at": "2026-08-24T11:27:42.652132+00:00", "price_overrides": {"AED": 168, "AUD": 65, "CAD": 60, "EUR": 31, "GBP": 36, "SGD": 60, "USD": 46}, "status": "draft"}, {"id": "5a9cd26f-1473-4a32-bab5-9794471e2c71", "slug": "Clear Sky Verse \u2014 Blue Sapphire Necklace", "category_id": "329b1cbc-d6d2-40bc-a1ef-4fb42b6cc011", "name": "Clear Sky Verse \u2014 Blue Sapphire Necklace", "description": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\">Blue Sapphire Necklace, natural stone in 925 sterling silver, made for everyday wear. Blue Sapphire is an Air gemstone \u2014 she carries the energy of wisdom, focus and truth, clear-headed like a cloudless sky. She is also September''s birthstone and the gemstone of Virgo (Aug 23 \u2013 Sep 22), a meticulous, devoted Earth sign, though her clarity is for anyone who wants to think a little straighter. 5mm, precision-cut stones, light enough to forget you''re wearing them. Wear her as your everyday verse of clear focus. Adorn your own gemstone and see your own truth clearly.</span></p>", "price": 2600.0, "compare_at_price": null, "sku": "RGGE019", "stock": 5, "gemstone": "blue sapphire", "cut": null, "carat": 0.5, "clarity": null, "metal": "925 Silver", "images": ["https://qsjzdfwvxshuazhgqoll.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/admin-media/2026/b23ff14b-42e3-4299-9a9f-fb153290259f-3I1A5794.jpg?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV85ZDgyYzI2Zi0zY2Y2LTQ1MTQtOWJlYy1hZjQ1MTlmNmE1ZmUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJhZG1pbi1tZWRpYS8yMDI2L2IyM2ZmMTRiLTQyZTMtNDI5OS05YTlmLWZiMTUzMjkwMjU5Zi0zSTFBNTc5NC5qcGciLCJzY29wZSI6ImRvd25sb2FkIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg2MzU1MjAwLCJleHAiOjI0MTcwNzUyMDB9.7y1L57quamY64HaUnNL45gcaUcV-4yUhrQu_yD2ESEE", "https://qsjzdfwvxshuazhgqoll.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/admin-media/2026/7450745e-ce6f-4e87-af5b-540f8e32e7f8-blue_sapp.jpg?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV85ZDgyYzI2Zi0zY2Y2LTQ1MTQtOWJlYy1hZjQ1MTlmNmE1ZmUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJhZG1pbi1tZWRpYS8yMDI2Lzc0NTA3NDVlLWNlNmYtNGU4Ny1hZjViLTU0MGY4ZTMyZTdmOC1ibHVlX3NhcHAuanBnIiwic2NvcGUiOiJkb3dubG9hZCIsImlhdCI6MTc4NjM1NTIwMiwiZXhwIjoyNDE3MDc1MjAyfQ.4ZEbSElMQimeUwHmBtn_Bv0ck19aBEcbxu68ePijj9A", "https://qsjzdfwvxshuazhgqoll.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/admin-media/2026/38f3869a-57c8-4c09-9722-d42701dc446f-back_f26a235b-af80-4e91-9e3c-a9cf3ab66617_1_.jpg?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV85ZDgyYzI2Zi0zY2Y2LTQ1MTQtOWJlYy1hZjQ