. Wear them alone for daytime polish, or add the pear drop and jacket attachments (sold separately, or as part of the full convertible set) whenever you want to dress them up.</span></p>", "price": 4000.0, "compare_at_price": null, "sku": "RG-SE-001c", "stock": 5, "gemstone": "Moissanite", "cut": "", "carat": null, "clarity": "", "metal": "925 Silver", "images": [], "is_new": false, "is_bestseller": false, "is_trending": false, "sort_order": 0, "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:12:09.519227+00:00", "meta_title": "Asha Moissanite Studs - 1.5ct Solitaire | Rosado Gems", "meta_description": "Discover Asha Moissanite Studs by Rosado Gems. 1.5ct moissanite solitaires in 925 silver for brilliant everyday wear. Perfect alone or with attachments.", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T10:12:09.519227+00:00", "price_overrides": {}, "status": "draft"}, {"id": "447b70e8-a526-4815-814e-0796d305c559", "slug": "navratna-energy-band", "category_id": "f62610a6-f2fe-4710-9c84-eb7200bae341", "name": "Power of 9 Gems Daily Band", "description": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">9 planets, 9 energies, 1 ring- a powerful house. This Navratna ring has them all in a row for balancing energies of the 9 planets according to Vedic astrology. All stones are natural set in sterling silver and representing: Ruby \u2014 confidence and leadership.<br>Pearl \u2014 calm and emotional balance.<br>Coral \u2014 courage and vitality.<br>Emerald \u2014 clarity and communication.<br>Yellow sapphire \u2014 wisdom and abundance.<br>Zircon \u2014 love and relationships.<br>Blue sapphire \u2014 discipline and focus.<br>Hessonite and cat''s eye \u2014 protection from instability.</span></p>", "price": 2800.0, "compare_at_price": null, "sku": "RGGE001", "stock": 5, "gemstone": "emerald, pearl, cat''s eye, blue sapphire, yellow sapphire, zircon, coral, ruby, garnet", "cut": null, "carat": 0.8, "clarity": null, "metal": "925 Silver", "images": ["https://qsjzdfwvxshuazhgqoll.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/admin-media/2