: 65, "CAD": 60, "EUR": 41, "GBP": 36, "SGD": 60, "USD": 46}, "status": "published"}, {"id": "22e8f41c-5edb-4b78-a88c-f83f32ded186", "slug": "Calm Verse \u2014 Turquoise Mala", "category_id": "329b1cbc-d6d2-40bc-a1ef-4fb42b6cc011", "name": "Calm Verse \u2014 Turquoise Mala", "description": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\">108-bead Jaap Mala, hand-strung with natural 6mm Turquoise beads in a continuous circle of prayer. Turquoise is a Water gemstone \u2014 she carries the energy of intuition, calm and honest communication, softening the edges of the count. The 109th bead, an 8mm lava rock guru bead, closes the circle and holds more than symbolism: its porous stone absorbs a drop of essential oil \u2014 lavender for calm, sandalwood for centering \u2014 turning every mantra into a small ritual of scent and breath. Finished with a hand-tied cotton tassel and delivered in a silk pouch that keeps her energy contained between uses. Cleanse with a pinch of salt before first wear, then let her calm settle over you, one bead at a time. Adorn your own gemstone and speak your own truth.</span></p>", "price": 2200.0, "compare_at_price": null, "sku": "RGGE039", "stock": 5, "gemstone": "turquoise", "cut": "", "carat": null, "clarity": "", "metal": "", "images": ["https://qsjzdfwvxshuazhgqoll.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/admin-media/2026/13ac8254-7f7b-4167-800e-9c787bb0d19c-IMG_9267.jpg?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV85ZDgyYzI2Zi0zY2Y2LTQ1MTQtOWJlYy1hZjQ1MTlmNmE1ZmUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJhZG1pbi1tZWRpYS8yMDI2LzEzYWM4MjU0LTdmN2ItNDE2Ny04MDBlLTljNzg3YmIwZDE5Yy1JTUdfOTI2Ny5qcGciLCJzY29wZSI6ImRvd25sb2FkIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg3NDI1NTQ1LCJleHAiOjI0MTgxNDU1NDV9.asI5k4ZL060eRiBnrX-lZ9RboUUD7DazdHdeEdEBvtU", "https://qsjzdfwvxshuazhgqoll.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/admin-media/2026/5e4a2829-23c2-44d6-a9ed-00cf098fd62d-IMG_9255.jpg?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV85ZDgyYzI2Zi0zY2Y2LTQ1MTQtOWJlYy1hZjQ1MTlmNmE1ZmUiLCJ