KPBmhXCohu_syWCZbP1xfKSWa41GcBEIVA"], "is_new": false, "is_bestseller": true, "is_trending": false, "sort_order": 27, "created_at": "2026-07-08T16:20:05.296774+00:00", "meta_title": "Manisha Convertible Earring Set - Rosado Gems", "meta_description": "Discover Rosado Gems'' Manisha Earring Set: 4 looks in 1! Lab-grown stones & 925 silver create versatile party wear. Travel light, show up stunning.", "updated_at": "2026-08-17T08:56:08.815151+00:00", "price_overrides": {}, "status": "published"}, {"id": "94b17abf-91bd-4e09-99ac-71ed07996c61", "slug": "Shadow Verse \u2014 Black Onyx Mala", "category_id": "00e60e51-ae64-47cf-8468-83008fa5e3de", "name": "Shadow Verse \u2014 Black Onyx Mala", "description": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\">108-bead Jaap Mala, hand-strung with natural 6mm Black Onyx beads in a continuous circle of prayer. Black Onyx is an Ether gemstone \u2014 dense and quiet, she carries the energy of protection, inner strength and deep spiritual grounding, holding space for the parts of the count that ask for stillness. The 109th bead, an 8mm lava rock guru bead, closes the circle and holds more than symbolism: its porous stone absorbs a drop of essential oil \u2014 lavender for calm, sandalwood for centering \u2014 turning every mantra into a small ritual of scent and breath. Finished with a hand-tied cotton tassel and delivered in a silk pouch that keeps her energy contained between uses. Cleanse with a pinch of salt before first wear, then let her hold the quiet with you. Adorn your own gemstone and sit with your own stillness.</span></p>", "price": 2200.0, "compare_at_price": null, "sku": "RGGE033", "stock": 5, "gemstone": "black onyx", "cut": "", "carat": null, "clarity": "", "metal": "", "images": ["https://qsjzdfwvxshuazhgqoll.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/admin-media/2026/a48fbb33-53b1-47bf-a1f9-ada9d6ab01de-IMG_8694.jpg?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV85ZDgyYzI2Zi0zY2Y2LTQ1MTQtOWJlYy1hZjQ1MTlmNmE1